#: Exif/Database.cpp:224
msgid ""
"<p>Congratulation, your KPhotoAlbum version now supports searching for EXIF "
"information.</p><p>For this to work, KPhotoAlbum needs to rescan your "
"images. Do you want this to happen now?</p>"
